      <label x="20" y="6" width="772" height="24" text="Heal" textColor="FFE8B84A" textSize="18" />
      <label x="20" y="150" width="772" height="40" text="The centre of the collection: the warm source, up to 96 partials. A strike throws the stretch past the key's edge; the tone tears, sags and wobbles, then relocks into a sustain resting at a third of its edge." textColor="FFE8E6DF" textSize="12" />
